  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1315.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1315.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the criteria for the annual inspection of a motor vehicle used for the purpose of transporting pupils and in determining its fitness to be designated a school bus, pursuant to RSA 266:7.\n\nSource. #4873, eff 07-24-90; ss by #6297, eff 7-23-96; ss by #8122, INTERIM, eff 7-17-04, EXPIRES: 1-13-05; ss and moved by #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1314.01); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1300.html"
